      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">",
      "css": ":host{--ak-display:'Archivo Black','Inter',sans-serif;--ak-sans:'Inter','Noto Sans TC',system-ui,sans-serif;--ak-mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;--bg:#0a0a0c;--surface:#111114;--surface-2:#17171a;--rule:#26262a;--rule-hi:#3a3a3f;--ink:#f3f2ee;--ink-2:#b6b5b0;--quiet:#6a6a6d;--invert:#f3f2ee;--invert-ink:#0a0a0c;--cyan:#18b6dc;--lg-dim:#8a8a8e} .ds-input{background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--rule-hi);color:var(--ink);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;font-size:15px;font-family:var(--ak-sans)}.ds-input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:1px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Top Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-link",
      "description": "Wordmark with cyan dot, quiet links, cyan inset underline on the current page.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-mark\" href=\"#\">arkiv<span>.</span></a><ul><li><a href=\"#\">首頁</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">運作方式</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">誠實清單</a></li></ul></nav>",
      "css": ":host{--ak-display:'Archivo Black','Inter',sans-serif;--ak-sans:'Inter','Noto Sans TC',system-ui,sans-serif;--ak-mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;--bg:#0a0a0c;--surface:#111114;--surface-2:#17171a;--rule:#26262a;--rule-hi:#3a3a3f;--ink:#f3f2ee;--ink-2:#b6b5b0;--quiet:#6a6a6d;--invert:#f3f2ee;--invert-ink:#0a0a0c;--cyan:#18b6dc;--lg-dim:#8a8a8e} .ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;min-height:56px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:var(--ak-sans)}.ds-nav-mark{font-family:var(--ak-display);font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-nav-mark span{color:var(--cyan)}.ds-nav ul{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:4px 18px;margin:0;padding:0}.ds-nav ul a{color:var(--ink-2);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}.ds-nav ul a:hover,.ds-nav ul a[aria-current=page]{color:var(--ink)}.ds-nav ul a[aria-current=page]{box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--cyan)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ledger Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "ledger-question",
      "description": "Signature: question (self-link) left, answer and mono evidence right, hairline above.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\" id=\"r1\"><h2 class=\"ds-q\"><svg class=\"ds-mk ds-mk-yes\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"做得到\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4.5 10.5l3.6 3.6 7.4-8.2\"/></svg><a href=\"#r1\">素材會不會<wbr>傳出去？</a></h2><div class=\"ds-a\"><p>不會。索引、逐字稿與縮圖都寫在<b>你自己的硬碟</b>上。</p><p class=\"ds-ev\">config.py · DATA_DIR = ~/.arkiv</p></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--ak-display:'Archivo Black','Inter',sans-serif;--ak-sans:'Inter','Noto Sans TC',system-ui,sans-serif;--ak-mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;--bg:#0a0a0c;--surface:#111114;--surface-2:#17171a;--rule:#26262a;--rule-hi:#3a3a3f;--ink:#f3f2ee;--ink-2:#b6b5b0;--quiet:#6a6a6d;--invert:#f3f2ee;--invert-ink:#0a0a0c;--cyan:#18b6dc;--lg-dim:#8a8a8e} .ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);gap:12px 48px;padding:28px 0 32px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--bg);font-family:var(--ak-sans)}.ds-row:target{border-top-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 var(--cyan)}.ds-q{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.005em;color:var(--ink);word-break:keep-all;margin:0}.ds-q a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-q a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--rule-hi);text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-q a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:2px}.ds-a{max-width:68ch;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-a p{margin:0}.ds-a > * + *{margin-top:12px}.ds-a b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.ds-ev{font-family:var(--ak-mono);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--lg-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-mk{flex:0 0 auto;width:20px;height:20px;margin-top:3px}.ds-mk-yes{color:var(--cyan)}@media (max-width:760px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}}"
    },
    {
