      "description": "Drawn SVG marks sharing one stroke: yes (cyan), no (coral), conditional (pencil).",
      "html": "<p class=\"ds-key\"><span><svg class=\"ds-mk ds-mk-yes\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"做得到\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4.5 10.5l3.6 3.6 7.4-8.2\"/></svg>做得到</span><span><svg class=\"ds-mk ds-mk-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"做不到\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5.5 5.5l9 9M14.5 5.5l-9 9\"/></svg>做不到</span><span><svg class=\"ds-mk ds-mk-cond\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"有條件\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 3.8l6.6 11.7H3.4z\"/></svg>有條件</span></p>",
      "css": ":host{--ak-display:'Archivo Black','Inter',sans-serif;--ak-sans:'Inter','Noto Sans TC',system-ui,sans-serif;--ak-mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;--bg:#0a0a0c;--surface:#111114;--surface-2:#17171a;--rule:#26262a;--rule-hi:#3a3a3f;--ink:#f3f2ee;--ink-2:#b6b5b0;--quiet:#6a6a6d;--invert:#f3f2ee;--invert-ink:#0a0a0c;--cyan:#18b6dc;--lg-dim:#8a8a8e} .ds-key{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;font-family:var(--ak-sans);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--lg-dim);background:var(--bg);padding:12px}.ds-key span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-mk{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-mk-yes{color:var(--cyan)}.ds-mk-no{color:#e2686d}.ds-mk-cond{color:var(--ink-2)}"
